    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "Эй, мужики, вы что?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hey, guys, what do you think you are doing?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Вы знаете?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you know who I am?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "Напугать меня хотите?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are you trying to scare me?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Я вас не боюсь.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am not afraid of you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "Можете делать со мной все.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You can do whatever you want to me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Что захотите.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Anything you want.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "А я все равно буду с Настей.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And I will still stay with Nastya no matter what.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Везете в лес?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are you taking me out to the woods?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "На обед.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'For family dinner.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Не нравишься ты мне.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I do not like you one bit.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "И она приехала.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And she came rushing right over to see me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "А ты ударил меня разок по носу.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'All because you punched me once in the nose.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "Извините еще раз.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Please forgive me once again.'",
      "gap": 0.65
